ver announces removed them.\n\nThe low-priority items include ignoring the client's requested protocol version, sessions that are issued but never checked, wrong `search_notes` snippet offsets, and the default dev token being published in the README.\n\nI stopped the server afterwards and removed my temporary files, so `ANSWER.md` is the only new file. The test note I created was only in memory and was lost when the server stopped; `notes.json` is unchanged.","ttft_ms":2331,"type":"result","duration_ms":123898,"uuid":"1ca4bfc1-9084-4fdf-a3e6-f33384f838a7","ttft_stream_ms":1487,"time_to_request_ms":64,"first_content_frame_ms":1487,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
